  "description": "CR 715.2b, 715.2c, 701.17a, 607.2a, 609.4b, 611.2a: King Narfi's Betrayal's chapter I mills each player four and lets its controller exile up to one creature or planeswalker card from each graveyard; II and III each let them cast those cards that turn, spending mana as though it were mana of any color",
